	<p>
		I'm <strong>Suresh Rajendiran</strong>, a Sr. Site Reliability Engineer with a decade of
		experience owning and operating mission-critical Kubernetes platforms on AWS and GCP. I have deep
		expertise in observability, incident management, infrastructure automation, and platform
