	<h2>What I'm learning now</h2>
	<p>
		These days I'm spending a lot of time learning <strong>AI and machine learning</strong> — from
		the fundamentals up through LLMs and how they fit into real systems. This blog is where I document
		that journey in public: what clicks, what confuses me, and how AI intersects with the
		infrastructure and reliability work I've done for years.
	</p>

